This happens in the background. You will receive a notification when it's done.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCIsThereAnyDealCollectionSyncModifiedCheckBoxSyncDuplicateHider">Sync multiple copies of the same game (DuplicateHider)</sys:String>
